{pad:meta title='Plan terms', about='Tips on the words of a price list, and the single tag as an information button.'/}
<div style="width:100%; max-width:520px; padding-top:40px">
  <h2>Pick a plan</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The {widget:tooltip 'Billed every month, cancel any time'}Starter plan{/widget:tooltip}: € 9 a month</li>
    <li>The {widget:tooltip 'Billed once a year - two months free'}Team plan{/widget:tooltip}: € 290 a year</li>
  </ul>
  <div>Prices include VAT {widget:tooltip 'Value added tax: 21% on most goods, 9% on food and books'/} and
  free {widget:tooltip 'Within the Netherlands and Belgium; elsewhere € 12', place='bottom'}delivery{/widget:tooltip}.</div>
</div>
